  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_first_00",
      "hash64": "7FD96AB20A9E1167",
      "text": "Guten Tag, liebe Schülerinnen und Schüler der\\nBlaubeer-Akademie![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_first_01",
      "hash64": "7FD969B20A9E0FB4",
      "text": "Ich bin Señora Quendella und hoffe, dass ihr\\nalle Spaß an meinem Unterricht haben werdet![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "4FFAB60DD7961919",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oh, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Dein Ruf eilt\\ndir\\r\\nvoraus![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "4FFAB50DD7961766",
      "text": "Du sollst hier an der Akademie als Champ ja eine\\nziemlich gute Figur abgeben![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "4FFAB40DD79615B3",
      "text": "Das ist wirklich beeindruckend. Als deine Lehrerin\\nmacht mich das ganz besonders stolz![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "4FFAB30DD7961400",
      "text": "Und denk daran, dass du mich jederzeit rufen\\nkannst, wenn du mich brauchst![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "0560A4FB7B835A05",
      "text": "Señora Quendella!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "0560A1FB7B8354EC",
      "text": "Ich nehme Sie beim Wort!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "4FFABA0DD7961FE5",
      "text": "Huch, da nimmt mich aber jemand sehr wörtlich.\\nWas für ein interessantes Kind du doch bist![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "7D29AC8554179265",
      "text": "Na, zumindest warnst du mich vor. Ich bin\\nschon gespannt![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "4FFAB90DD7961E32",
      "text": "Du hast mit den Klubaktivitäten und deinen\\nAbenteuern sicher beide Hände voll zu tun,\\r\\naber vergiss darüber das Lernen nicht![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "A92F74271EE73C26",
      "text": "Das kommt vielleicht etwas plötzlich, aber wo wir\\ngerade beim Thema sind, möchte ich dir gerne\\r\\neine Testfrage zur Auffrischung stellen.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "A92F75271EE73DD9",
      "text": "Wie hoch ist üblicherweise die Wahrscheinlichkeit\\nfür einen Volltreffer?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "7E29763B191ED428",
      "text": "Etwa 1 %",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "7E29793B191ED941",
      "text": "Etwa 4 %",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "7E29783B191ED78E",
      "text": "Etwa 12 %",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "A92F72271EE738C0",
      "text": "Oh... Da liegst du leider ein wenig daneben.\\c\\nDie korrekte Lösung lautet 4 %. Du musst dein\\nGedächtnis wohl noch etwas besser trainieren![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "62D79A7982E53B46",
      "text": "Sehr gut, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nIch hatte nichts anderes von dir erwartet. Du hast\\ndas erlernte Wissen wirklich bestens verinnerlicht![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "A92F73271EE73A73",
      "text": "Darf ich dir etwas anvertrauen?\\c\\nIch mache mir ein wenig Sorgen um die\\nSchülerschaft der Blaubeer-Akademie...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "A92F78271EE742F2",
      "text": "Abgesehen vom Kampfkurs und vom sonstigen\\nUnterricht rund ums Thema Kämpfe gibt es hier\\r\\nkein großes Lernangebot.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "A92F79271EE744A5",
      "text": "Falls es wem gelingt, später mal einen Beruf\\nzu finden, wo sich dieses Wissen tatsächlich\\r\\nanwenden lässt, ist das natürlich schön und gut.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "A92F76271EE73F8C",
      "text": "Aber was ist mit den anderen? Jenen, deren\\nTräume nicht wahr werden? Verbaut man ihnen\\r\\nso nicht vorzeitig alle Karrierechancen?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "A92F77271EE7413F",
      "text": "Wir müssen den jungen Leuten zeigen, dass es\\nganz unterschiedliche Lebensentwürfe gibt.\\c\\nDafür braucht man ein breit aufgestelltes\\nLernangebot: Mathematik, Hauswirtschaftslehre,\\r\\nFremdsprachen und vieles mehr...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 215,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "A92F7C271EE749BE",
      "text": "Unnützes Wissen gibt es nämlich nicht. Das ist\\nzumindest meine Überzeugung.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "A92F7D271EE74B71",
      "text": "Verzeih bitte den langen Vortrag.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "7E297B3B191EDCA7",
      "text": "Kein Problem!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_05",
      "hash64": "7E297A3B191EDAF4",
      "text": "Das war sehr lehrreich!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_10",
      "hash64": "A932FA271EEA55AF",
      "text": "Hach, du bist so ein liebes Kind! Ich werde\\njedenfalls mal sehen, was sich da tun lässt.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "7D958A20BDDA2EB7",
      "text": "Danke, dass du mir neulich so aufmerksam\\nzugehört hast, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "7D958920BDDA2D04",
      "text": "Ich hatte direkt im Anschluss eine Unterredung\\nmit dem Direktor und habe ihn darum gebeten,\\r\\ndas Angebot abseits des Kampfkurses etwas\\r\\nzu erweitern.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "CF14DDD21EF44623",
      "text": "Und wie lief es?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "CF14DED21EF447D6",
      "text": "Das ist echt toll von Ihnen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "7D958C20BDDA321D",
      "text": "Der Direktor sagte, dass eine Änderung der\\nPflichtfachbelegung zwar nicht möglich sei,\\r\\nzusätzlicher Unterricht aber über Wahlfächer\\r\\nangeboten werden könne.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "7D958B20BDDA306A",
      "text": "Er meinte sogar, dass dies mit Grund dafür war,\\ndich damit zu beauftragen, diverse Mentoren an\\r\\ndie Akademie zu berufen.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
